---
layout: base.njk
title: Scripts
description: Ready-to-run PowerShell scripts for beginners. Parameterized, with comment-based help, and a preview mode before anything changes.
permalink: /scripts/
---
<header class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">Ready-made</p>
  <h1>Scripts</h1>
  <p class="lede">Parameterized, with <code>-WhatIf</code>. Download or copy. Pass paths in. Never hardcode yours.</p>
</header>

<div class="card-grid">
  {% for item in collections.scripts %}
    <a class="card" href="{{ item.url }}">
      <p class="kicker">{{ item.data.difficulty or "script" }}</p>
      <h2>{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ item.data.summary }}</p>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
